From d3f0b9661428ffee631f3cecc7d4876e35edf3e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:51:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(machine): define AC trunnion kinematics fields and
 non-RTCP flag

Preserve depth-first parent-child rotary chain order via
`AxisLimits.chain_order` and `AxisLimits.parent` while keeping
`Machine.axes` in `controller.synced_configuration` coordinate order.
Add optional unit-scaled `pivot: [x, y, z]`, child `offset: [dx, dy, dz]`,
`zero_offset` (deg), `rollover` (bool), and explicit `sign_convention`
(`tool_rh` | `table_rh`) with shared validation in `parse_mch` and
`validate_text`. Add optional `controller.rtcp` (bool) so non-RTCP
trunnions mirror `machine.rtcp = false` alongside full rotary chain
metadata, refuse G43.4 in `fanuc.cps` and `doosan-dnm.cps`, and bump
`PROJECT_VERSION` from 63 to 64 (stacked on #2126).

Fixes #1962
